Revision history for Alien-nghttp3

0.01  2026-10-02
    - Initial development version.
    - Discover libnghttp3 1.18.0 or newer through pkg-config.
    - Build a private static nghttp3 1.18.0 fallback from vendored source
      when no suitable system installation is available.
    - Keep fallback installation independent of network access.
    - Keep the fallback build limited to libnghttp3.
    - Keep the distribution independent of QUIC implementations, TLS,
      event loops, HTTP frameworks, and Net::QUIC.
    - Support Perl 5.20 and newer.
    - Require Alien::Build 2.84 or newer.
    - Verify the native library with a real XS compile and link test.
